note The one place a camera move is honoured, in priority order: a pending look at the focus, then a kept node. A node taller than the canvas is aligned to its top, because its header and its buttons are what the reader came for; centring it put them off screen. Nothing here runs unless a flag asked for it, so a rebuild or a re-index leaves pan and zoom alone.
